<title>JAPAN: Toyota Sept domestic output up 18.6% yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Toyota Sept domestic output up 18.6% yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp said on Friday that its domestic vehicle production, exports, domestic sales and overseas output in September were as follows:</p>
<p> Production	  302,621   up 18.6 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars	     249,825   up 21.2 percent</p>
<p>  - Trucks &amp; Buses  52,796   up  7.9 percent</p>
<p> Domestic sales    183,784   up  3.3 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars	     127,571   up  5.4 percent</p>
<p>  - Trucks &amp; Buses  56,213  down 1.2 percent</p>
<p> Exports	     115,614   up 29.1 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		86,989   up 36.3 percent</p>
</text>
